    {
      "id": "part-4",
      "title": {
        "en-US": "The seconde boke whych confuteth the defence of Tyndale for his translacyon of the new testament"
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "chapter-88",
          "title": {
            "en-US": "An answere vnto the fyrst chapyter of Tyndales boke, why he trāslateth this worde chyrche in to this worde co"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "chapter-89",
          "title": {
            "en-US": "The secunde chapyter why Tyndale vsed congregacyon for chyrche •"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "chapter-90",
          "title": {
            "en-US": "Agaynste Tyndales vsynge this worde senior and elder, and not preste"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "chapter-91",
          "title": {
            "en-US": "Agaynste Tyndales translatynge of charitas in to loue rather then into cheryte"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "chapter-92",
          "title": {
            "en-US": "Agaynste 〈…〉 fauour in stede of grace"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "chapter-93",
          "title": {
            "en-US": "〈◊〉 Tyndales chaungynge of confessyon in to knowlege, & penauns into repentauns"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "part-5",
      "title": {
        "en-US": "The thyrde boke, Here after foloweth the thyrde boke, in whyche be treated two chapyters of Tyndales boke / th"
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "chapter-94",
          "title": {
            "en-US": "whether the chyrche were before the gospell, or the gospell before the chyrche"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "chapter-95",
          "title": {
            "en-US": "whyther the apostles left aught vnwriten, that is of necessyte to be byleued"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
